@startuml flow-money
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: Money Flow - Who Pays, Who Gets Paid, and How the Platform Earns

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #E65100
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}
top to bottom direction

actor "User" as User
actor "Provider" as Provider
actor "ParkEase platform\n(system admins)" as Platform

rectangle "SSLCOMMERZ\nmerchant account of\nParkEase BD" as SSL #E3F2FD
rectangle "Booking Held Funds\n(escrow in ledger)" as Held
rectangle "Provider wallet\npending -> available" as PW
rectangle "Platform Revenue\n(ledger account)" as Rev
rectangle "User Refund Balance\n(User wallet)" as RB
rectangle "Provider's bank /\nbKash / Nagad / Rocket" as PBank #E3F2FD
rectangle "User's bank /\nmobile wallet" as UBank #E3F2FD

User --> SSL : 1. Pays total =\nparking charge\n+ platform fee\n+ refundable deposit
RB --> Held : 1b. or pays part/all\nfrom Refund Balance
SSL --> Held : 2. Validated payment\nheld until the session\nis settled

Held --> PW : 3a. Parking charge\n+ paid overtime\n(or cancellation\nfee kept)
Held --> Rev : 3b. Platform fee\n(default 10% of the\nparking charge)
Held --> RB : 3c. Unused deposit and\ncancellation refunds

PW --> PBank : 4. Payout request ->\nAdmin approves ->\nmanual transfer ->\nmarked PAID
Rev --> Platform : 5. Platform keeps its fee;\nSSLCOMMERZ settles gateway\nreceipts to ParkEase's bank
PBank --> Provider : 4b. Provider receives\nthe money
RB --> UBank : 6. Optional withdrawal\n(Admin-processed)
RB --> User : or reused automatically\non the next booking

note bottom of Rev
  Example from testing: 1 hour at Tk 12/hour
  User paid Tk 413.20 = Tk 12 parking + Tk 1.20 fee + Tk 400 deposit.
  No-show settlement: Provider Tk 12, Platform Tk 1.20,
  Tk 400 back to the User's Refund Balance.
end note

@enduml
